00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:40.670
to spotlight these stories and go and
delve in and now all of that's anyone

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:46.550
any one sort of with their own agenda or
their own need to tell a story and a

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:55.310
camera or a phone can do that what are
your thoughts I think I think ultimately

00:00:55.310 --> 00:00:59.990
what I'm what I'm getting from the
question is it's kind of a larger a

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:06.290
larger issue about like the ability to
get stories out there right I mean we

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:11.900
all have Twitter right Twitter's a
storytelling device in X number of

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.109
characters or less all of these devices
all of these apps are newfangled stories

00:01:18.109 --> 00:01:22.880
and we're all kind of technically our
own little filmmaker I don't think

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:32.179
that's the same as making a film there's
a responsibility in making a film if

00:01:32.179 --> 00:01:35.420
you're making a film about something
that's true if you're making a film

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:39.109
about something that's about real life
or if you're even making a scripted film

00:01:39.109 --> 00:01:42.829
about something that's historical
fiction you know you have a

00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:48.649
responsibility as the filmmakers to do
justice to that story otherwise you're

00:01:48.649 --> 00:01:52.670
going to slip into the propaganda
universe and just be filling the world

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:59.149
with more of that and I think filmmakers
are bold and they're on the frontier

00:01:59.149 --> 00:02:04.399
they're truth seekers I think that's
true of even the best scripted

00:02:04.399 --> 00:02:08.780
filmmakers you know I mean I think back
to BOYS DON'T CRY you know and what

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:14.390
Kimberly Peirce did you know that was an
incredibly powerful i opening experience

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:18.980
that the world hadn't seen before
and she did tremendous justice to that i

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:23.690
think we you know that's i like that
your site is called Film Courage because

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:26.270
that's the kind of courage
that that it takes to be a filmmaker you

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:29.900
